+    records branch and theta_key; the reader uses branch (the A150 Phase-2 gate), theta_key, physical_u_A (SV3) and the
+    spec pins (SV0 / SV3). Compared as canonical JSON, so floats compare bitwise (the record's floats round-trip
+    exactly). theta_key and phase1_snapshot are checked by replay_specs before this. Not re-derived (named):
+    FILL_FIELDS_NOT_REPLAYED (producer custody, fill-time information) and CASE_FIELDS_NOT_REPLAYED (make_plan's sidecar
